\u00e4ltetechnik) spielerisch entdecken und erste berufstypische Aufgaben ausprobieren. Ob Technik, Gesundheit oder Handwerk \u2013 finde heraus, was dir am meisten Spa\u00df macht! :)\n\nEarly Access: Sei unter den Ersten, die jobVRiety testen!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "3902217326706597", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393450_3902217330039930_1240378813803928232_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MxbrsZPo2pUQ7kNvwFEYSqu&_nc_oc=AdouuvJuY4PyOZE-QmHGEFwKmp9OgWrdqPWcwCxp8B70SO-69nLAHBgQzM3lXOA1MT8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR5yAH0_t-PWgWqbm_Tsk6aYsFcoMKPKwJwBfR-nx4wEA&oe=6B05C376"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_1080x360.png", "id": "3076099412552471", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825091_3076099415885804_5417180118801740963_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jA5QWOfzy0wQ7kNvwFtQLv9&_nc_oc=AdrjOxwH_oNNdRvo1O7h276Ac0gTnv22qzOmRSWsEVXL4J9eHshWeBM62QPsr5QDxWA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTN6Z-Asw01IG1CaVnAESpyBNXgtW4Bsyy2bOfnVratUA&oe=6B05BF76"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateSquare_1440x1440.png", "id": "2448391595528830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824609_2448391598862163_943533169723644988_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ARryVHIKHxkQ7kNvwG_a37q&_nc_oc=Ado6tQRJcnv63s4Rwpi2eWQFVWVO9FLNdlS2KOdCeE1bTmARmwk5qQ31TABc5Ily2t4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQJVSFwQNYbj9nNgPWEtHv3wyNwFnwHxNZX25ccISqGxQ&oe=6B05C3FE"}, {"file_name": "JobVR_LogoClaim_rgb.png", "id": "1748084809102207", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "u